In either case, it doesn't matter who flips the coin first, since on either side it will be the same probability that Alice will flip heads, and thus, Alice will win with probability $p$. So, we have $$p = \frac12 \cdot 1 + p\cdot\frac12 \cdot p = \frac12+p\cdot\frac12p.$$Solving for $p$ gives $$p = \boxed{\frac{2}{3}}.$$
